title: mf repo fold
tags: [[CLI command]]
kind: reference
summary: Fold now what writes to many records left pending


Folds at once what the writes to many records left pending, one list at a time, and
prints how many lists it folded (`0` when nothing was pending): what the daemon does
by itself after thirty seconds without activity ([[Folding in idle time]]), through
`POST /repos/:repo/fold`. [[mf repo wear]] says what is pending.
